You send a saw mounted on an automated steam propulsor to assault a foe, dealing [38, 51, 62, 70, 78 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] physical damage each turn for 4 turns and silencing it.

At the end of the duration, the saw explodes for [197, 266, 318, 363, 403 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage and flies back, pulling the target up to [2, 5, 7, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] tiles towards you.

The damage will increase with your Steampower.
